  "title": "InCLAD: A Continual Learning Benchmark for Industrial Visual Anomaly Detection",
  "summary": "InCLAD introduces a continual industrial anomaly detection benchmark that frames the task-incremental problem, addressing gaps in static benchmarks by considering sequential exposure to heterogeneous components. The framework evaluates continual performance across image-level and pixel-level anomaly detection, aiming to improve knowledge retention, adaptation, and generalization in evolving industrial environments.",
